scribed at the top, acting as a poetic title or seal carving, in an elegant clerical or semi-cursive script, dark ink color.\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#1E00FF\"]\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [144, 86, 349, 421],\n                \"desc\": \"The sun, stylized as a subtle white or light yellow circle, partially veiled by morning mist, avoiding harsh brightness to maintain the tranquil mood\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#F50000\"]\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [565, 97, 899, 501],\n                \"desc\": \"A rustic, woven bamboo lounge chair positioned to the right. Its minimalist design echoes the 'lounging amidst nature' ideal.\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [353, 580, 912, 776],\n                \"desc\": \"An elderly man in a simple robe leaning against the pine tree's trunk. He looks towards the vast landscape, his small scale against nature emphasizing the Daoist ideal of harmony. A wooden staff rests beside him\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [254, 809, 963, 971],\n                \"desc\": \"A venerable pine tree on the left, dominating the vertical axis with its twisted, ancient trunk and expansive canopy framing the scene. Its rugged texture (cunfa) suggests age and resilience.\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#000000\"]\n            }\n        ]\n    }\n}"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 335, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 241, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "625efbfa2fc20c31797dfffcbb41a26b6d91ab7b", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "